Z||000000||lildevil||10-03-2001||08:07 PM||||Got a call yesterday that i have dreamed about for years!  High Performance magazine got the photos i sent in and want me to be in one of their shoot outs next week!  I am happy and so freakin nervous at the same time. I mean what if my car doesn't run like its supposed too?  If it runs 13.3's I 'll be happy.  I may throw on the 3.25 pulley i got but i tried it last week and got serious Knock retard. They wouldn't tell me what other cars were goin to be in the shoot out with me. Did anyone else get a call?<P>------------------<BR>Earl Sessions<BR>1985 Fiero w/ 1998 Supercharged 3.8 V-6<BR>Best ET: 13.232 @ 101.24 mph<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/water3quarterthumb.jpg"> ||||reg||10
