Z||000021||lildevil||10-04-2001||06:57 PM||||Thanx for all the support. The photo shoot will be Oct 11th at Englishtown raceway.  I am only aloud to bring one other person and that honor goes to my brother. Mainly cause he knows how to use a video camera.  I bought some new spark plugs and reset the computer. I will add the racing fuel so i hope this will guarantee some good times. If not i'll throw on the 3.25 pulley and keep my fingers crossed.  They called me again today asking if i had slicks to run on.  I don't and besides...where would i put them?  They kinda prefer that the cars in the shootout run slick or drag radials.  Since i don't use them at the track when i go and i prefer to race my car the way it is set up everyday i drive it i don't think i am goin to rush out and buy a set.  But i may paint my car green this weekend  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">It looks good.  But my  lil brother will be more then a lil ticked.  I also have never seen a fiero in the shootout and I brought that up in the letter that accompanied the pics i sent in. Maybe this will change there minds.  Especially if all you fiero owners go out and buy the issue and make it the best selling High Performance Pontiac EVER!!! Then they'd be stupid not to put more Fieros in their magazine. I personally plan on buying 50 of them.<P>I'll let everyone know when it comes out.<P><P>------------------<BR>Earl Sessions<BR>1985 Fiero w/ 1998 Supercharged 3.8 V-6<BR>Best ET: 13.232 @ 101.24 mph<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/water3quarterthumb.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000022||gangrenefiero||10-04-2001||10:44 PM||||Your exactly right i'd be upset. How many "Devils" are green anyway. I say we all get in our fieros and follow you up to the shoot out and watch from outside the gates. It would be like we are following the leader to the promise land or something  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> And maybe they will take pics of our cars and put them in there too! <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/green_neeper_1.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/uforiagman/pic/greenfierorealthumb.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000023||NOS3800||10-04-2001||11:28 PM||||I am going to give some support. (i'm the brother) I will be the guy that helps him do the burnouts and when he backs up after the pro style burnout I will be in front helping him backup  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> I sent my writeup and pics in the same envelope as my brother and am wondering why mine wasn't picked  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> I woulda thought it would be neat to have all Fieros running, but I haven't recieved any notices from other Fiero owners. So I will drive mine up there too and maybe they will let me run and maybe I will impress them or something.<BR>BTW, LilDv1l is an auto painter so he can change the color of his car every weekend. If you are wondering what your car would look like a certain color, I am sure he will paint his, then send you pics so you can see how you like it! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><BR>Oh, I am posting pic of my car so all three brothers cars will be like ducks in  a row!<P>------------------<BR>Purple 1988 GT<BR>NOS injected 3800 Series II V6<BR>Best ET(75 shot)-13.45@101.12 mph<BR>w/o NOS 14.86@92.06mph<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SIDE_SHOT_Bill.jpg"> ||||reg||10
